# --- Working documents ---
# Progress journals carry embedded screenshots and are regenerated per revision,
# so they would add megabytes to the history for no benefit. The repository holds
# source and the README; narrative documentation lives outside it.
*.docx
commit_msg.txt

# --- Editors & IDEs ---
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp

# --- OS ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
